			"hadithnumber": 4298,
			"arabicnumber": 4298,
			"text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:“The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: “No one will enter Hell except one who is doomed.” It was said: “O Messenger of Allah, who is the one who is doomed?” He said: “The one who never does any act of obedience (towards Allah) and who never omitted any act of sin.”",
